---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Professional research profile and research notes of Dr Dilini Perera.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Food science · grains · plant-based foods</p>
      <h1>{{ site.name }}</h1>
      <p class="hero-role">{{ site.role }}</p>
      <p class="hero-tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="/research/">Explore research</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/publications/">View publications</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-panel" aria-label="Research profile summary">
      <div class="portrait-placeholder">
        <img src="/assets/images/profile-placeholder.svg" alt="Placeholder for Dr Dilini Perera profile photograph">
      </div>
      <div class="hero-facts">
        <span>{{ site.affiliation }}</span>
        <span>{{ site.location }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research focus</p>
      <h2>From processing to structure, functionality and nutrition.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid four">
      <article class="card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Grains & oats</h3><p>Understanding quality, composition and processing behaviour in cereals and grain-based ingredients.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Plant proteins</h3><p>Exploring plant-derived ingredients, functionality and opportunities for nutritious food applications.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Food processing</h3><p>Examining how thermal and non-thermal processing changes food structure and performance.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card-number">04</span><h3>Digestibility & shelf-life</h3><p>Connecting processing decisions with nutritional behaviour, product stability and quality over time.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Research approach</p>
      <h2>Applied food science with a strong analytical foundation.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose compact">
      <p>My work focuses on practical questions at the intersection of food processing, ingredient functionality and nutrition. I am particularly interested in how processing conditions influence the structure and performance of grains, plant proteins and food ingredients.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about my background →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading row-between">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Latest</p><h2>Research notes</h2></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All posts →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="post-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read note →</a>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-section">
  <div class="container cta-card">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Collaborate</p><h2>Interested in food science, grain processing or plant-based research?</h2></div>
    <a class="button" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>
